<title>SINGAPORE: First Engineering incorporates company.</title>
<headline>First Engineering incorporates company.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Engineering Ltd said on Friday it had established a wholly-owned private limited company in Singapore to operate as an investment holding company.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the new company, Mikron First Engineering Pte Ltd, would change its name to Mikron FEL Pte Ltd upon approval by the Registrar of Companies.</p>
<p>Mikron FEL would then acquire First Engineering's entire equity interest in First Engineering Precision Mould and Plastic Co (Suzhou) Co Ltd and in Shi-Cheng Precision Moulds and Plastics (Shanghai) Co Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
